  "title": "What your CRM doesn't tell its AI (but your Digital Sales Room does)",
  "summary": "Most CRM AI tools work from structured CRM fields, email metadata, and call transcripts. What they miss is everything that happens when your rep isn't actively selling. That 10pm proposal view, the repeat visits to the business case, the new stakeholder added three days before a decision call – all of that lives in the Deal Room.",
